OL,3,A'This star is for Africa' - Angelique
OL,4,AKidjo on making Hollywood Walk of Fame
OL,5,Ahistory
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive-time Grammy award winner Angelique
OL,8,FKidjo, who made history on Tuesday to
OL,9,Fbecome the first African musician to
OL,10,Fget a star on the Hollywood Walk of
OL,11,FFame, has told the BBC she wants to
OL,12,Fdedicate the accolade to the continent
OL,13,Fof her birth.
OL,15,F"This star is for all the continent of
OL,16,FAfrica. Because if I was not African,
OL,17,Fwould I be here?" said the 66-year-old
OL,18,Fmusical icon from Benin.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,173,160,100,200,0,100
