OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'This star is for Africa' - Angelique
OL,4,AKidjo on making Hollywood Walk of Fame
OL,5,Ahistory
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe reiterated her message, made at the
OL,8,Fceremony in Los Angeles to mark her
OL,9,Ffour-decade career, about the
OL,10,Fimportance of Africans to the world of
OL,11,Fmusic.
OL,13,F"Without the blues brought by the
OL,14,Fslaves in America, there's no R&B,
OL,15,Fthere's no rock and roll, there's no
OL,16,Fsoul music, there's no jazz. All of it
OL,17,Fcomes from Africa."
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
